cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this public research overview, please cite this repository."
title: "Principia Structurae Realitatis: A Structural Reasoning Framework for Whole-System Coordination in LLMs"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "CosmicUndercurrent"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-09-22
repository-code: "https://github.com/CosmicUndercurrent/Principia-Structurae-Realitatis"
url: "https://github.com/CosmicUndercurrent/Principia-Structurae-Realitatis"
license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  Principia Structurae Realitatis is an exploratory research project on how
  component interactions, evolving requirements, and operating conditions
  relate to the reliability of complex systems and AI-assisted work.
  This public edition provides general research themes and evaluation
  considerations without publishing its underlying theoretical formulation.
keywords:
  - large language models
  - complex systems
  - system-level evaluation
  - AI reasoning
  - reliability
  - long-horizon tasks
  - empirical comparison
